<h1>Backend demo</h1>

<p>
  This static page calls a tiny <a href="https://github.com/JulianErskine/site-api">FastAPI backend</a>
  running on my home server, reached over a
  <a href="https://tailscale.com/kb/1223/funnel">Tailscale Funnel</a> — no
  server-side rendering here, just a browser <code>fetch()</code> to another
  origin.
</p>

<form id="echo-form">
  <label>Message <input type="text" id="echo-input" value="hello from the browser"></label>
  <button type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
<p id="echo-status"></p>
<pre id="echo-result"></pre>

<script>window.SITE_API_BASE = {{ site.apiBase | dump | safe }};</script>
<script src="/js/backend-demo.js" defer></script>
